,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:32.395Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"3670\",\"ticker\":\"will-there-be-another-nfl-scorigami-in-november-2021\",\"slug\":\"will-there-be-another-nfl-scorigami-in-november-2021\",\"title\":\"Will there be another NFL Scorigami in November 2021?\",\"description\":\"In sports, a Scorigami is a scoring combination that has never happened before in a sport or league's history. \\n\\nIn NFL's history, there have been 1069 unique scores. The most recent Scorigami for an NFL game occurred on November 4, 2021, when the Indianapolis Colts defeated the New York Jets by a score of 45–30.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if at least one more NFL Scorigami will occur after the market inception date, November 15, 2 PM ET, and before the market resolution time, November 30, 12:00 PM ET.\\nOtherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is an official NFL website (https://www.nfl.com/scores/), however other sites tracking Scorigamis will be helpful (https://nflscorigami.com/, https://twitter.com/NFL_Scorigami)\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-11-15T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-11-13T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-11-30T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":5195.29,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at