e most recent (as of December 30) Scorigami for an NFL game occurred on December 12 2021, when the Kansas City Chiefs defeated the Las Vegas Raiders by a score of 48–9.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if at least one more NFL Scorigami will occur between December 30, 12:00:01 AM ET, and before the market resolution time, January 10 2022, 12 PM ET.\\nOtherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is an official NFL website (https://www.nfl.com/scores/), however other sites tracking Scorigamis will be helpful (https://nflscorigami.com/, https://twitter.com/NFL_Scorigami)\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-12-30T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2022-01-10T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-there-be-another-1072nd-nfl-scorigami-by-january-10-96195e08-1f90-4527-ac28-28921c1a9d7d.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-there-be-another-1072nd-nfl-scorigami-by-january-10-96195e08-1f90-4527-ac28-28921c1a9d7d.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":25665.49,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:40:35.984+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:35.987Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-23T15:49:22.720752Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:35.987Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"3750\",\"ticker\":\"nfl-will-the-sum-of-points-in-vikings-v-steelers-be-an-even-or-an-odd-number\",\"slug\":\"nfl-will-the-sum-of-points-in-vikings-v-steelers-be-an-even-or-an-odd-number\",\"title\":\"NFL: Will the sum of points in Vikings v. Steelers be an even or an odd number?\",\"description\":\"In the upcoming NFL game between Minnesota Vikings and Pittsburgh Steelers, scheduled for December 9:\\n\\nIf the total sum of points scored is an even number (ie. score is 20-10, 14-24, 21-17...), this market will resolve to “Even”.\\n\\nIf the total sum of points scored is an odd number (ie. score is 20-27, 13-20, 10-17...), this market will resolve to “Odd”.\\n\\nIf the game is not completed by December 16, 2021, the market will resolve 50-50.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"http://nfl.com/scores\",\"startDate\":\"2021-12-09T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-12-07T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-12-09T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl-will-the-sum-of-points-in-vikings-v-steelers-be-an-even-or-an-odd-number-531f310a-f989-4cbc-8abd-27ff552b2069.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl-will-the-sum-of-points-in-vikings-v-steelers-be-an-even-or-an-odd-number-531f310a-f989-4cbc-8abd-27ff552b2069.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":403.89,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:40:36.466+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:36.469Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-25T19:47:38.214423Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:36.469Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"3791\",\"ticker\":\"chiefs-6-v-browns-spread\",\"slug\":\"chiefs-6-v-browns-spread\",\"title\":\"Chiefs (-6) v. Browns Spread\",\"description\":\"This is a market on whether the Kansas City Chiefs will cover a 6 point spread against the Cleveland Browns in their NFL week 1 matchup scheduled to take place on September 12, 2021. This market will resolve to “Chiefs” if the Chiefs win by over 6 points, and “Browns” if the Browns lose by less than 6 points or win. If the final point spread is exactly 6 points and favors the Chiefs, the market will resolve 50-50 If the match is postponed to a date on or before October 12, 2021, the same market conditions will apply. If the match is postponed to a date after October 12, 2021, or canceled altogether, the market will resolve 50-50.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-09-09T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-09-09T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-09-12T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/chiefs-6-v-browns-spread-5f3c635f-785d-4753-bb70-c6eda75bc443.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/chiefs-6-v-browns-spread-5f3c635f-785d-4753-bb70-c6eda75bc443.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":4026.26,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:40:38.037+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:38.042Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-25T18:57:30.130114Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:38.042Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"3792\",\"ticker\":\"will-matthew-stafford-stay-in-first-as-nfls-player-with-most-passing-yards-on-november-27\",\"slug\":\"will-matthew-stafford-stay-in-first-as-nfls-player-with-most-passing-yards-on-november-27\",\"title\":\"Will Matthew Stafford have the most passing yards in the 2021 NFL season on November 27th?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if Los Angeles Rams' player Matthew Stafford is the player with the most Passing Yards in the 2021 season on the resolution date, November 27, 12PM ET. Otherwise, the market will resolve to \\\"No.\\\"\\n\\nThe resolution source is the official statistics of National Football League (https://www.nfl.com/stats/player-stats/).\\n\\nIf the data is not available on the resolution time, another credible source will be used.\\n\\nIf Matthew Stafford ties with another player for most passing yards, this market will resolve 50-50.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/stats/player-stats/category/passing/2021/REG/all/passingyards/DESC\",\"startDate\":\"2021-11-16T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-11-16T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-11-27T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-matthew-stafford-have-the-most-passing-yards-in-the-2021-nfl-season-on-november-27th-03705ee5-2e71-4a31-84fc-37624e58082e.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-matthew-stafford-have-the-most-passing-yards-in-the-2021-nfl-season-on-november-27th-03705ee5-2e71-4a31-84fc-37624e58082e.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":858.74,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:40:38.078+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:38.081Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-23T22:56:45.922575Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:38.081Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"3795\",\"ticker\":\"will-the-first-4-picks-in-the-nfl-draft-all-be-quarterbacks\",\"slug\":\"will-the-first-4-picks-in-the-nfl-draft-all-be-quarterbacks\",\"title\":\"Will the first 4 picks in the NFL draft all be quarterbacks?\",\"description\":\"This is a market on whether the first 4 overall picks in the NFL draft will be quarterbacks. This market will resolve to “Yes” if the first, second, third, and fourth overall picks in the NFL draft are all listed as quarterbacks as their primary position. This market will resolve to “No” otherwise. The resolution source for this market will be the live television broadcast of the draft as well as official NFL sources (https://www.nfl.com/draft/) or other credible sports databases if necessary (i.e. https://www.pro-football-reference.com/years/2020/draft.htm). In the event of ambiguity in terms of the market outcome, the market will be resolved in good faith at the sole discretion of the Markets Integrity Committee (MIC)\\n\\nThis market will resolve after the first four picks have been announced in the NFL draft. If the NFL draft is delayed, this market will be delayed until the NFL Draft takes place and the first four picks have been announced. If the NFL draft still has not taken place by June 1, 2021, 12:00 PM ET, this market will resolve 50-50.\",\"startDate\":\"2021-04-27T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-04-27T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-06-01T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":6468.86,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:40:38.181+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:38.184Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-22T01:57:13.897025Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:38.184Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"3809\",\"ticker\":\"nfl-will-the-packers-beat-the-ravens-by-more-than-5pt5-points-in-their-december-19-matchup\",\"slug\":\"nfl-will-the-packers-beat-the-ravens-by-more-than-5pt5-points-in-their-december-19-matchup\",\"title\":\"NFL: Will the Packers beat the Ravens by more than 5.5 points in their December 19 matchup?\",\"description\":\"In the upcoming NFL game, scheduled for December 19:\\n\\nIf the Green Bay Packers win by over 5.5 points, the market will resolve to “Yes”.\\n\\nIf the Baltimore Ravens lose by less than 5.5 points or win, the market will resolve “No.” \\n\\nIf the game is not completed by December 26, 2021, the market will resolve 50-50.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate