t will resolve to “Yes”.\\n\\nIf the Detroit Lions lose by less than 5.5 points or win, the market will resolve “No.” \\n\\nIf the game is not completed by January 2, 2022, the market will resolve 50-50.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-12-26T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-12-23T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-12-26T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl-will-the-falcons-beat-the-lions-by-more-than-55-points-in-their-december-26-matchup-a5e2e211-2a32-4101-8cf5-ad6c568b308b.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl-will-the-falcons-beat-the-lions-by-more-than-55-points-in-their-december-26-matchup-a5e2e211-2a32-4101-8cf5-ad6c568b308b.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":4292.25,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:40:43.969+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:43.972Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-23T22:49:42.74028Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:43.972Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"3952\",\"ticker\":\"superbowl-lvi-will-the-point-difference-be-greater-than-5p5\",\"slug\":\"superbowl-lvi-will-the-point-difference-be-greater-than-5p5\",\"title\":\"Superbowl LVI: Will the point difference be greater than 5.5?\",\"description\":\"The NFL 2021-22 season will conclude with Super Bowl LVI, the league's championship game. It will be played between the National Football Conference (NFC) champion Los Angeles Rams and the American Football Conference (AFC) champion Cincinnati Bengals on February 13, 2022, at SoFi Stadium in Inglewood, California.\\n\\nThis market is about the total final point difference in the Superbowl LVI game, including overtime.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if the point difference is greater than 5.5. This market will resolve to \\\"No\\\" if the point difference is less than 5.5.\\n\\n---------------------\\n\\nPlease note, the point difference is the absolute difference between points counted for each of the teams at the end of the game (including overtime).\\n\\nFor example, if the final score is 9:1, 11:3, 7:15... - then the point difference equals 8;\\nif the final score is 13:11, 22:20, 12:14... - then the point difference equals 2, etc...\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/\",\"startDate\":\"2022-02-07T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2022-02-02T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2022-02-13T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/superbowl-lvi-will-the-point-difference-be-greater-than-55-5d7084f4-3f5e-4acc-b926-68704a9e38c6.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/superbowl-lvi-will-the-point-difference-be-greater-than-55-5d7084f4-3f5e-4acc-b926-68704a9e38c6.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":true,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":3678.88,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:40:44.29+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:44.293Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-25T19:43:42.979037Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-