er 28, 2021, or canceled altogether, the market will resolve 50-50. In the event of ambiguity in terms of the market outcome, the market will be resolved in good faith at the sole discretion of the Markets Integrity Committee (MIC).\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-08-28T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-08-26T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-08-28T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":1462.98,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:40:54.657+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:54.66Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-22T01:51:37.572214Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:54.66Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"4231\",\"ticker\":\"will-there-be-nfl-scorigami-in-december-2021\",\"slug\":\"will-there-be-nfl-scorigami-in-december-2021\",\"title\":\"Will there be an NFL Scorigami in December 2021?\",\"description\":\"In sports, a Scorigami is a scoring combination that has never happened before in a sport or league's history. \\n\\nIn NFL's history, there have been 1070 unique scores. \\n\\nThe most recent (as of November 29) Scorigami for an NFL game occurred on November 21, 2021, when the Indianapolis Colts defeated the Buffalo Bills by a score of 41–15.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if at least one more NFL Scorigami will occur between December 1, 12:00:01 AM ET, and before the market resolution time, December 31, 11:59 PM ET.\\nOtherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is an official NFL website (https://www.nfl.com/scores/), however other sites tracking Scorigamis will be helpful (https://nflscorigami.com/, https://twitter.com/NFL_Scorigami)\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-11-29T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-11-29T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-there-be-an-nfl-scorigami-in-december-2021-e8b5c01a-0867-4d2c-9b5d-e161530b756b.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-there-be-an-nfl-scorigami-in-december-2021-e8b5c01a-0867-4d2c-9b5d-e161530b756b.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":4360.75,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:40:54.794+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:54.797Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-23T06:37:17.119873Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:54.797Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"4243\",\"ticker\":\"panthers-4-v-jets-spread\",\"slug\":\"panthers-4-v-jets-spread\",\"title\":\"Panthers (-4) v. Jets Spread\",\"description\":\"This is a market on whether the Carolina Panthers will cover a 4 point spread against the New York Jets in their NFL week 1 matchup scheduled to take place on September 12, 2021. This market will resolve to “Panthers” if the Panthers win by over 4 points, and “Jets” if the Jets lose by less than 4 points or win. If the final point spread is exactly 4 points and favors the Panthers, the market will resolve 50-50 If the match is postponed to a date on or before October 12, 2021, the same market conditions will apply. If the match is postponed to a date after October 12, 2021, or canceled altogether, the market will resolve 50-50. \",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-09-09T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-09-09T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-09-12T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/panthers-4-v-jets-spread-8fd4bdb0-3b51-4055-9498-c7c1b62b08ac.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/panthers-4-v-jets-spread-8fd4bdb0-3b51-4055-9498-c7c1b62b08ac.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":1742.49,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:40:55.267+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:55.27Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-25T20:43:28.727554Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:40:55.27Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"4246\",\"ticker\":\"will-the-ravens-beat-the-colts-by-more-than-7pt5-poi