-seahawks-by-more-than-35-points-in-their-november-14th-matchup-5123e04e-3f43-4108-8ab6-a975af2b445d.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":12806.09,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:41:14.029+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:14.032Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-25T19:01:03.956267Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:14.032Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"4747\",\"ticker\":\"will-the-49ers-beat-the-raiders-by-more-than-5pt5-points-in-their-nfl-preseason-matchup\",\"slug\":\"will-the-49ers-beat-the-raiders-by-more-than-5pt5-points-in-their-nfl-preseason-matchup\",\"title\":\"Will the 49ers beat the Raiders by more than 5.5 points in their NFL preseason matchup?\",\"description\":\"This is a market on whether the San Francisco 49ers will beat the Las Vegas Raiders by over 5.5 points in their NFL preseason matchup scheduled to take place on August 29, 2021. This market will resolve to “Yes” if the San Francisco 49ers win by over 5.5 points, and “No” otherwise. If the match is postponed to a date on or before September 29, 2021, the same market conditions will apply. If the match is postponed to a date after September 29, 2021, or canceled altogether, the market will resolve 50-50. In the event of ambiguity in terms of the market outcome, the market will be resolved in good faith at the sole discretion of the Markets Integrity Committee (MIC).\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-08-29T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-08-29T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-08-29T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-49ers-beat-the-raiders-by-more-than-55-points-in-their-nfl-preseason-matchup-6aa0ce90-78aa-42f9-bf64-f39f31dbbcd0.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-49ers-beat-the-raiders-by-more-than-55-points-in-their-nfl-preseason-matchup-6aa0ce90-78aa-42f9-bf64-f39f31dbbcd0.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":2796.9,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:41:14.14+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:14.143Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-23T22:47:14.926609Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:14.143Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"4768\",\"ticker\":\"will-teams-from-the-afc-or-nfc-win-more-games-in-the-2021-nfl-preseason-week-1\",\"slug\":\"will-teams-from-the-afc-or-nfc-win-more-games-in-the-2021-nfl-preseason-week-1\",\"title\":\"Will teams from the AFC or NFC win more games in the 2021 NFL Preseason Week 1?\",\"description\":\"This is a market on whether more games in Week 1 of the 2021 NFL Preseason will be won by teams in the AFC or in the NFC. For the purposes of this market, games for the 2021 NFL Preseason Week 1 will consist only of those NFL preseason games played between Thursday, August 12, 2021 and Sunday, August 15, 2021, inclusive. This market will resolve to \\\"AFC\\\" if, excluding intra-conference games (i.e., games between two AFC teams or between two NFC teams), teams in the AFC win more games in the NFL's Preseason Week 1 than teams in the NFC do. This market will resolve to \\\"NFC\\\" if, excluding intra-conference games, teams in the NFC win more games in the NFL's Preseason Week 1 than teams in the AFC do. This market will resolve 50/50 if, excluding intra-conference games, teams in the AFC and teams in the NFC win the same number of games. Membership in the AFC or NFC is determined according to the conference listings on the NFL webpage at: https://www.nfl.com/teams/. A current listing of games scheduled for NFL Preseason Week 1 is available on the NFL webpage at: https://www.nfl.com/schedules/ by selecting \\\"2021\\\" and \\\"Preseason Week 1\\\" from the drop-down menus. If a game currently listed on that schedule is rescheduled to a date after August 15, 2021, it will not be counted for the purposes of this market. In the event of ambiguity in terms of the market outcome, the market will be resolved in good faith at the sole discretion of the Markets Integrity Committee (MIC).\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-08-12T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-08-12T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-08-15T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-teams-from-the-afc-or-nfc-win-more-games-in-the-2021-nfl-preseason-week-1-0f96ebc8-952d-4c57-a06d-589155b51c57.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-teams-from-the-afc-or-nfc-win-more-games-in-the-2021-nfl-preseason-week-1-0f96ebc8-952d-4c57-a06d-589155b51c57.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\