 sites tracking Scorigamis will be helpful (https://nflscorigami.com/, https://twitter.com/NFL_Scorigami)\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-12-17T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-12-15T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-there-be-another-1072nd-nfl-scorigami-in-december-2021-14559ba4-19ee-457e-a4d0-1c7288836a13.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-there-be-another-1072nd-nfl-scorigami-in-december-2021-14559ba4-19ee-457e-a4d0-1c7288836a13.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":9683.37,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:41:30.117+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:30.12Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-23T15:50:35.829501Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:30.12Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"5193\",\"ticker\":\"will-the-patriots-beat-the-giants-by-more-than-3-points-in-their-nfl-preseason-matchup\",\"slug\":\"will-the-patriots-beat-the-giants-by-more-than-3-points-in-their-nfl-preseason-matchup\",\"title\":\"Will the Patriots beat the Giants by more than 3 points in their NFL preseason matchup?\",\"description\":\"This is a market on whether the New England Patriots will beat the New York Giants by over 3 points in their NFL preseason matchup scheduled to take place on August 29, 2021. This market will resolve to “Yes” if the New England Patriots win by over 3 points, and “No” otherwise. If the match is postponed to a date on or before September 29, 2021, the same market conditions will apply. If the match is postponed to a date after September 29, 2021, or canceled altogether, the market will resolve 50-50. In the event of ambiguity in terms of the market outcome, the market will be resolved in good faith at the sole discretion of the Markets Integrity Committee (MIC).\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-08-29T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-08-29T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-08-29T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-patriots-beat-the-giants-by-more-than-3-points-in-their-nfl-preseason-matchup-2a0d85f9-67b0-46f7-a177-484258cebef6.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-patriots-beat-the-giants-by-more-than-3-points-in-their-nfl-preseason-matchup-2a0d85f9-67b0-46f7-a177-484258cebef6.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":6354.03,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:41:30.989+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:30.992Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-23T22:47:48.13784Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:30.992Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslatio