\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":2799.21,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:41:40.736+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:40.739Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-25T19:08:13.352125Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:40.739Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"5461\",\"ticker\":\"will-mac-jones-be-the-3rd-pick-in-the-nfl-draft\",\"slug\":\"will-mac-jones-be-the-3rd-pick-in-the-nfl-draft\",\"title\":\"Will Mac Jones be the 3rd pick in the NFL draft?\",\"description\":\"This is a market on whether Mac Jones will be the 3rd overall pick in the NFL draft, scheduled to begin on April 29, 2021. This market will resolve to “Yes” if Mac Jones is selected third overall in the NFL draft. This market will resolve to “No” if Mac Jones is not selected third overall in the NFL draft. The resolution source for this market will be the live television broadcast of the draft as well as official NFL sources (https://www.nfl.com/draft/). This market will resolve after a third pick has been announced in the NFL draft. If the NFL draft is delayed, this market will be delayed until the NFL Draft takes place and the third pick has been announced. If the NFL draft still has not taken place by June 1, 12:00 PM ET, this market will resolve to 50-50.\\n\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/draft/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-04-27T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-04-27T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-04-29T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-mac-jones-be-the-3rd-pick-in-the-nfl-draft-3d38b2fa-d435-42e1-8628-0349fc618069.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-mac-jones-be-the-3rd-pick-in-the-nfl-draft-3d38b2fa-d435-42e1-8628-0349fc618069.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":50512.5,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:41:41.412+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:41.415Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-25T20:43:10.4728Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:41:41.415Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"5570\",\"ticker\":\"nfl-playoffs-wildcard-21-22\",\"slug\":\"nfl-playoffs-wildcard-21-22\",\"title\":\"NFL: 2021–22 Wildcard playoffs\",\"description\":\"This is a market group on the first round of 2021–22 National Football League playoffs,  dubbed the wild-card playoffs or wild-card weekend.\\n\\nCurrently, seven teams from each of the league's two conferences qualify for the playoffs. A tie-breaking procedure exists if required. \\n\\nIn wildcard playoffs, the second-seeded division winner hosts the seventh seed wild card, the third seed hosts the sixth seed, and the fourth seed hosts the fifth seed. \\n\\nThe tournament culminates in the Super Bowl LVI on February 13, in which two teams, one from each conference, play each other to become champion of the NFL.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/\",\"startDate\":\"2022-01-15T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2022-01-13T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2022-01-17T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl-202122-wildcard-playoffs-484e465a-fb5f-4405-9964-8f6326f38b8e.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl-202122-wildcard-playoffs-484e465a-fb5f-4405-9964-8f6326f38b8e.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":true,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":75742.68,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"descending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:42:15.155+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:42:15.158Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-25T21:07:14.238894Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:42:15.158Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"5633\",\"ticker\":\"nfl-playoffs-divisional-21-22\",\"slug\":\"nfl-playoffs-divisional-21-22\",\"title\":\"NFL: 2021–22 Divisional playoffs\",\"description\":\"This is a market group on the second round of 2021–22 National Football League playoffs, dubbed the divisional playoffs.\\n\\nIn the Divisional round, which is scheduled for the weekend of January 22–23, the top seed in the conference will play the lowest remaining seed and the other two remaining teams will play each other. The winners of those games will advance to the Conference Championships, which are scheduled to be played on January 30.\\n\\nThe tournament culminates in the Super Bowl LVI on February 13, in which two teams, one from each conference, play each other to become champion of the NFL.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"http://nfl.com/scores\",\"startDate\":\"2022-01-20T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2022-01-19T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2022-01-22T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl-202122-divisional-playoffs-b0abf22d-01fa-447e-9da7-15d579825cf7.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl-202122-divisional-playoffs-b0abf22d-01fa-447e-9da7-15d579825cf7.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":true,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":974887.98,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"descending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:42:49.566+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:42:49.569Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-25T19:56:24.030976Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:42:49.569Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"5698\",\"ticker\":\"2022-NFL-Draft\",\"slug\":\"2022-NFL-Draft\",\"title\":\"2022 NFL Draft\",\"description\":\"The National Football League Draft, also called the NFL Draft or (officially) the Player Selection Meeting, is an annual event which serves as the league's most common source of player recruitment. Each team is given a position in the drafting order in reverse order relative to its record in the previous year, which means that the last place team is positioned first and the Super Bowl champion is last. From this position, the team can either select a player or trade its position to another team for other draft positions, a player or players, or any combination thereof. The round is complete when each team has either selected a player or traded its position in the draft. The first draft was held in 1936, and has been held every year since.\\n\\nThe 2022 NFL Draft, the 87th edition of the National Football League's annual draft, is scheduled to be held April 28–30, 2022, at Caesars Forum on the Las Vegas Strip, in Paradise, Nevada.\",\"startDate\":\"2022-04-28T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2022-04-28T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2022-04-30T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Repetitive-markets/DraftNFL.jpg\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Repetitive-markets/DraftNFL.jpg\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":true,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":25343.51,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-07-27 14:43:23.014+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-27T14:43:23.019Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-22T02:00:26.66375Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-07-27T14:43:23.019Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"5839\",\"ticker\":\"who-will-win-the-NFL-21-22-superbowl\",\"slug\":\"who-will-win-the-NFL-21-22-superbowl\",\"title\":\"Who will win the NFL ‘21-22 Superbowl?\",\"description\":\" This is a 