s market will resolve to “Raiders”.\\n\\nIf the game ends in a tie, this market will resolve 50-50.\\n\\nIf the game is not completed by August 11 (11:59:59 PM ET), this market will resolve 50-50.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2022-08-05T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2022-08-03T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2022-08-04T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":true,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":0,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-08-03 19:20:45.597+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-08-03T19:20:45.601Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-22T01:47:36.137432Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"enableOrderBook\":true,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-08-05T07:15:48Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"5957\",\"ticker\":\"nfl-preseason-who-will-win-new-york-giants-v-new-england-patriots-scheduled-for-august-11-700-pm-et\",\"slug\":\"nfl-preseason-who-will-win-new-york-giants-v-new-england-patriots-scheduled-for-august-11-700-pm-et\",\"title\":\"NFL Preseason: Who will win New York Giants v. New England Patriots, scheduled for August 11, 7:00 PM ET?\",\"description\":\"In the upcoming NFL preseason game scheduled for August 11, 7:00 PM ET:\\n\\nIf the New York Giants win, this market will resolve to “Giants”.\\n\\nIf the New England Patriots win, this market will resolve to “Patriots”.\\n\\nIf the game ends in a tie, this market will resolve 50-50.\\n\\nIf the game is not completed by August 18 (11:59:59 PM ET), this market will resolve 50-50.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2022-08-12T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2022-08-08T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2022-08-11T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":true,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":0,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-08-08 17:43:41.624+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-08-08T17:43:41.627Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-22T01:51:37.572214Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-08-12T17:03:28Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"5960\",\"ticker\":\"nfl-preseason-who-will-win-minnesota-vikings-v-las-vegas-raiders-scheduled-for-august-14-425-pm-et\",\"slug\":\"nfl-preseason-who-will-win-minnesota-vikings-v-las-vegas-raiders-scheduled-for-august-14-425-pm-et\",\"title\":\"NFL Preseason: Who will win Minnesota Vikings v. Las Vegas Raiders, scheduled for August 14, 4:25 PM ET?\",\"description\":\"In the upcoming NFL preseason game scheduled for August 14, 4:25 PM ET:\\n\\nIf the Minnesota Vikings win, this market will resolve to “Vikings”.\\n\\nIf the Las Vegas Raiders win, this market will resolve to “Raiders”.\\n\\nIf the game ends in a tie, this market will resolve 50-50.\\n\\nIf the game is not completed by August 21 (11:59:59 PM ET), this market will resolve 50-50.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/scores/\",\"startDate\":\"2022-08-15T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2022-08-08T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2022-08-14T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nfl.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":true,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":0,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"category\":\"Sports\",\"published_at\":\"2022-08-08 17:57:58.724+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-08-08T17:57:58.728Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-03-22T01:39:16.085177Z\",\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"enableOrderBook\":true,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-08-15T02:45:41Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"6030\",\"ticker\":\"what-will-the-final-score-points-spread-be-for-super-bowl-55\",\"slug\":\"what-will-the-final-score-points-spread-be-for-super-bowl-55\",\"title\":\"What will the final score points spread be for Super Bowl 55?\",\"description\":\"This is a scalar market on the point spread of the final score (not including overtime) of NFL Super Bowl 55. To resolve, at the end of regulation time, the losing team's score can be subtracted from the winning team's score, and the difference will be the resolution of this market. In the event of a tie, and subsequent overtime, this market will resolve to 0.\\n\\nThe lower bound for this market is 0 points, and the upper bound is 14 points. You can use the calculator to the right (underneath the Buy modal) to calculate how each Long or Short Token price corresponds with points spread. Long and Short shares will settle proportionally to the outcome value if the final value is between these bounds, but if the final value exceeds either the upper or lower bound, the price of each Outcome Token is capped at $1 and $0. In the event of ambiguity in terms of the market outcome, the market will be resolved in good faith at the sole discretion of the Markets Integrity Committee (MIC).\\n\\nIn the event of any postponement of the Super Bowl, this market will not be resolved until the game is played.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/super-bowl/\",\"startDate\":\"2021-02-07T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-02-07T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-02-08T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/what-will-the-final-score-points-spread-be-for-super-bowl-55-455b17f7-f972-4d25-8286-ca92311c881a.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/what-will-the-final-score-points-spread-be-for-super-bowl-55-455b17f7-f972-4d25-8286-ca92311c881a.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":62551.75,\"openInterest\":0,\"sortBy\":\"ascending\",\"published_at\":\"2022-08-22 15:24:40.664+00\",\"createdAt\":\"2022-08-22T15:24:40.672Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2024-04-25T19:51:48.015663Z\",\"commentsEnabled\":false,\"competitive\":0,\"volume24hr\":0,\"volume1wk\":0,\"volume1mo\":0,\"volume1yr\":0,\"liquidityAmm\":0,\"liquidityClob\":0,\"commentCount\":3787,\"tags\":[{\"id\":\"100215\",\"label\":\"All\",\"slug\":\"all\",\"forceShow\":false,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-17T20:23:54.340488Z\",\"requiresTranslation\":false}],\"cyom\":false,\"closedTime\":\"2022-08-22T15:24:40.672Z\",\"showAllOutcomes\":false,\"showMarketImages\":true,\"enableNegRisk\":false,\"seriesSlug\":\"nfl\",\"negRiskAugmented\":false,\"pendingDeployment\":false,\"deploying\":false,\"requiresTranslation\":false},{\"id\":\"6100\",\"ticker\":\"will-the-titans-or-the-ravens-win-their-january-10th-nfl-wild-card-matchup\",\"slug\":\"will-the-titans-or-the-ravens-win-their-january-10th-nfl-wild-card-matchup\",\"title\":\"Will the Titans or the Ravens win their January 10th NFL Wild Card matchup?\",\"description\":\"This is a market on which team will win the Jan 10th NFL Wild Card matchup between the Tennessee Titans and the Baltimore Ravens. This game is set to take place on January 10th, 2021 at Nissan Stadium. This market will resolve according to whichever team wins, with winning outcome tokens being redeemable for $1 and losing outcome tokens being worth $0. In the event this match ends in a tie, post overtime, the market will resolve at 50/50, meaning Titans and Ravens shares will both be redeemable for $.50. If the game is postponed, the same rules will apply for whenever the match is played, until February 1st 2021, when it was resolve 50:50. Results of this market will be decided by official scores available on https://www.nfl.com/.\",\"resolutionSource\":\"https://www.nfl.com/games/ravens-at-titans-2020-post-1\",\"startDate\":\"2021-01-06T00:00:00Z\",\"creationDate\":\"2021-01-06T00:00:00Z\",\"endDate\":\"2021-01-11T00:00:00Z\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-titans-or-the-ravens-win-their-january-10th-nfl-wild-card-matchup-8cf36505-6d41-4679-987c-f59beaeed629.png\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-titans-or-the-ravens-win-their-january-10th-nfl-wild-card-matchup-8cf36505-6d41-4679-987c-f59beaeed629.png\",\"active\":true,\"closed\":true,\"archived\":false,\"new\":false,\"featured\":false,\"restricted\":false,\"liquidity\":0,\"volume\":20653.